    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Columnar cell change, ER stain",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Columnar cell change often has uniform ER expression (this is not helpful as a marker to distinguish columnar cell change from flat epithelial atypia or atypical ductal hyperplasia).",
